## What still stands from my note 03
The **calculation-rigor standard**, which is unchanged and is mine to enforce:
- explicit conversion factors as fractions with units, never "just give the number";
- units carried on every line of working;
- final answer to correct significant figures, no premature rounding of intermediates;
- a `status: draft` tag and a section tag on every item;
- re-derive each numeric result once independently before writing it down.

